# 设计
## 概述
Correct root input path only, no edit of five frozen source files or source authentication semantics.
## 技术方案
对应需求：FR-1、FR-2、FR-3。
Parse original helper AST constants and literal input sizes, cross-check actual input bytes/SHA before delegate, not merely lease equality. Current existing complete public key already used in original signed-source preparation; minimalkey is an independently retained failure input. Ordinary genuine verify_git_source executes GPG dearmor and signature verification against decompressed tar with the same fixed fingerprint checks, original bounds and owned evidence only. Root source5 and input/tool snapshots before/after guard current component. New rootonce02 captures exact completekey input and unchanged archive/sign source5/runtime/msgfmt; never reuses failed once01.
## 文件结构
Three new standalone specs; ordinary private component result and new rootonce02 launcher/fence. All original five source files unchanged.
